4.3 Configuration
=================

Below, we highlight some of Lena's user options; for the complete list,
use ‘M-x customize-group RET lena RET’.

   You can bind custom keys in ‘lena-mode-map’:

     (keymap-set lena-mode-map "C-c ." #'highlight-symbol-at-point)

   To automatically enable features (e.g.  Eglot) when Lena is started,
customize ‘lena-mode-hook’ as follows:

     (add-hook 'lena-mode-hook #'eglot-ensure)

