5 Contribute
************

We welcome contributions of any kind!  Especially, bug reports and PRs
addressing open issues.  If you are interested in extending Lena and
upstreaming changes, please open a feature request as an issue on
GitHub.  For more details, see CONTRIBUTING.org
(https://github.com/ISTA-PLV/lena/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.org).

* Menu:

* Reporting Problems::


File: lena.info,  Node: Reporting Problems,  Up: Contribute

5.1 Reporting Problems
======================

When something looks wrong, ‘M-x lena-snapshot’ records the state of
Lena, Eglot and Lean under ‘lena-snapshot-directory’; call it before
restarting anything.  Its most useful part is Eglot's events log, which
Eglot limits to 2 MB and Doom Emacs turns off:

     (with-eval-after-load 'eglot  ; in Doom: (after! eglot ...)
       (setq eglot-events-buffer-config '(:size 50000000 :format full)))

   A snapshot contains your file and the others that the server opened;
check it before sharing it.


